cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this atlas, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Medical Image Atlas: retinal, mammography and prostate pathology"
abstract: >-
  A multi-domain atlas of what is seen in medical images, what can be measured and on which images:
  anatomy, lesions, measurement items with open measurement code, grading criteria and diseases for
  retinal imaging, mammography and prostate pathology, illustrated with CC BY / CC0 public images.
authors:
